# FATE — ODS integration analysis

## Executive summary

FATE addresses expert-offload latency by predicting which experts will be needed before the next layer's routing decision is fully available, enabling proactive prefetch.

**ODS classification: P1 capability candidate.**

## Relevant capability

FATE is especially valuable for an adaptive execution layer because prediction can hide storage or host-to-device transfer latency.

## ODS integration

Rather than requiring FATE to become a complete ODS runtime, its prediction/prefetch technique can be composed with an expert cache and an existing serving backend.

The reported research speedups are research results and must not be treated as LEONES measurements until independently reproduced.